        <!-- Database Schema Info -->
        <mxCell id="schema-info" value="&lt;b&gt;Database Schema&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;This ERD shows the complete database structure for the Nailed by Via appointment scheduling system.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Main Business Flow:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Users register and login&lt;br&gt;2. Browse available services&lt;br&gt;3. Book appointments&lt;br&gt;4. Add services to favorites&lt;br&gt;5. View gallery of work&lt;br&gt;6. Admin manages all data&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;System Features:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Activity logging for audit&lt;br&gt;• Settings management&lt;br&gt;• Session handling&lt;br&gt;• Queue system&lt;br&gt;• Caching support" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#2E7D32;fillColor=#E8F5E8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#333333;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
